{"unit_id":"CN-Leo__dsh-deepseek-balance#feature-1","repo":"CN-Leo/dsh-deepseek-balance","commit":"0f15218466ee61cbfab831b6eda0bfcf6f5514a1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-deepseek-balance 的功能「余额显示」：在 DSH Web 会话输入框下方显示 DeepSeek 账户余额与可用状态。组件加载后每 15 秒请求一次 Host 路由，并以状态圆点和文字呈现加载、成功或失败。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:9-10","client/client.js:81-104","client/client.js:112-140","client/client.js:177-191"]}
